	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_tutorial"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せいげんじかんないに　きのみを
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]こいじょう　あつめよう！
まちや　みちの　キラキラひかる
ばしょを　さがせ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-11-27T03:51:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-09-18T08:49:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>制限時間内に　きのみを
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]個以上　集めよう！
街や道の　キラキラ光る
場所を　探せ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-28T11:07:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-09-20T06:12:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-09-24T06:26:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-09-24T06:26:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_item_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せいげんじかんないに　かけらを
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]こいじょう　あつめよう！
まちや　みちの　キラキラひかる
ばしょを　さがせ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:18:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:13:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>制限時間内に　かけらを
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]個以上　集めよう！
街や道の　キラキラ光る
場所を　探せ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-28T11:07:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:13:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:13:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:13:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_item_02b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せいげんじかんないに　おたからを
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]こいじょう　さがせ！
ほらあなや　もりの　キラキラひかる
ばしょを　さがせ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-13T02:05:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:22:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>制限時間内に　お宝を
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]個以上　探せ！
洞穴や森の　キラキラ光る
場所を　探せ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-28T11:07:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:22:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:22:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:22:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_item_02w"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほらあなや　もりに　おちている
どうぐを　ひろい　あつめろ！
おたからが　みつかるかも！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-13T01:57:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:26:38" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>洞穴や森に　落ちている
道具を　拾い　集めろ！
お宝が　みつかるかも！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-13T01:58:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:26:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_item_02_s"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うしなわれた　こだいの
ざいほうを　さがしだせ！
もちろん　そんな　かんたんに
みつかる　はずも　ないだろうが……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:44:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:22:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>失われた　古代の
財宝を　探し出せ！
もちろん　そんな簡単に
みつかるはずも　ないだろうが……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-24T07:33:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:22:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:22:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:22:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_item_03b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>キラキラひかる　こうせきを　さがせ！
ほらあなや　みちを　さがして
おちている　どうぐを
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]こいじょう　あつめよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-11-27T14:14:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:26:38" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キラキラと　光る鉱石を　探せ！
洞穴や道を　探して
落ちている　道具を
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]個以上　集めよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-28T11:07:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:26:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_item_03w"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>キラキラひかる　こうせきを　さがせ！
ほらあなや　みちを　さがして
おちている　どうぐを
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]こいじょう　あつめよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-11-27T14:16:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:27:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キラキラと　光る鉱石を　探せ！
洞穴や道を　探して
落ちている　道具を
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]個以上　集めよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-28T11:07:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
