			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>珍しい　きのみが　みつかった！
森や　洞穴の　キラキラ光る
場所を　探して
きのみを　集めよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-20T03:04:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-12T13:43:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文（配信）
※ふしぎなおくりもの</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-12T13:44:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文（配信）
※ふしぎなおくりもの</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2012-01-12T13:44:02" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_npc_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せいげんじかんないに　まいごを
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]にんいじょう　さがせ！
まちや　みちにいる
おとこのこに　はなしかけよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T11:01:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:26:38" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>制限時間内に　迷子を
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]人以上　探せ！
街や道にいる　男の子に
話しかて　助けてあげよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T03:47:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:26:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_npc_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どうぐを　なくして　こまっている
たんパンこぞうを　さがせ！
せいげんじかんないに
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]にんいじょう　たすけよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T11:09:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:51:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>道具を　なくして　困っている
たんパンこぞうを　探せ！
制限時間内に
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]人以上　助けよう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T05:22:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:51:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_npc_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かけだしの　かくとうかと　たたかい
しゅぎょうの　おてつだいを　しよう！
せいげんじかんないに
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]にんいじょう　たおせ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T11:07:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:51:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>かけ出しの　格闘家と　戦い
修行の　お手伝いを　しよう！
制限時間内に
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]人以上　倒せ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T03:47:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:51:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_npc_03_s"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かけだしの　かくとうかと　たたかい
しゅぎょうの　おてつだいを　しよう！
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]にん　たおせば　せいこう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-11-28T02:07:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:51:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>かけ出しの　格闘家と　戦い
修行の　お手伝いを　しよう！
[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]人　倒せば　成功！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T03:47:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T10:51:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</CommentCell>
