		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ホドモエのはねばしに
おちている　はねを　あつめよう！
ポケモンの　はばたく　おとが
きこえたら　そのちかくを　さがせ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-11-28T00:49:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:33:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ホドモエの跳ね橋に
落ちている　羽を　集めよう！
ポケモンの　はばたく　音が
きこえたら　その近くを　探せ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T03:45:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:40:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8000</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_evt_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かくちの　ほらあなで
みつかる　おたからを　あつめよう！
ボコボコと　つちけむりの
あがる　ばしょを　さがせ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-09-24T06:33:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:36:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>各地の　洞穴で
みつかる　お宝を　集めよう！
ボコボコと　土煙のあがる
場所を　探せ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-29T03:45:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:40:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ミッション説明文</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:42:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8000</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_fm_explain_evt_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　タマゴを
ふか　させよう！
たくさん　あるいて！
たくさん　はしって！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-11-28T00:51:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="masafumi_saitou:W00225"
				Time="2011-08-26T12:38:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　タマゴを
ふか　させよう！
たくさん　歩いて！
たくさん　走って！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-31T10:20:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
